   "text": "Global Banking School - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nGlobal Banking School\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nGBS provides a range of sector-relevant courses across campuses in the UK, Malta and the United Arab Emirates. Working in partnership with several leading higher education providers, we deliver vocational, undergraduate and postgraduate programmes in banking, finance, accounting, business, tourism, healthcare – and more.Malta Campus in St Julians provides Master's degrees and offers excellent transport and connections with Valetta and around the Island.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n17/07/2026 07:57\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n26/03/2026 07:30\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nMalta\nYearly Fees\nMax: €8,000.00\nMin: €6,000.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n20%\n4,000 of 20,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n2010\nCampus(es)\nSan Ġiljan\nCountry\nMalta\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n27/04/2023\nContract End Date\n01/01/2036\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\n-\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZYbwHEm9stY\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
